| description = In North Kaladim can be found the [[Warrior]] Guildhall of Storm Guard. Guildmaster [[Furtog Ogrebane]] leads the guild and can often be found overlooking the small arena in front of the guild. 

The Storm Guard warriors support the Dwarven [[King Kazon Stormhammer]], the [[Merchants of Kaladim]] and the Paladin's guild called [[Miners Guild 249]]. 

They deal war against the incursions of [[Krag]], [[Pickclaw Goblins]], [[Clan Runnyeye]], [[Riptide Goblins]], and [[Crushbone Orcs]]. They have a specific hatred for the [[Craknek Warriors]] of Oggok. With a name like Ogrebane, somehow this is not surprising.

